<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PairGain cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PairGain cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James said it downgraded PairGain Technologies Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Late on Thursday, PairGain posted lower-than-expected second quarter revenues and operating margins.</p>
<p>-- PairGain lost 1-9/16 to 16-11/16.</p>
</text>
